        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12285999?u=183d27a6aca0718cb83ecec3c8e7745502384f48&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds performance considerations section to <code class=\"notranslate\">:has()</code> documentation based on feedback from Firefox engineers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40280.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3216082362\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40280\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40280/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40280\">#40280</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40688",
            "title": "docs(css): add performance considerations for :has() pseudo-class",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-18T08:30:12.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-10T20:07:32.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Shrinivassab",
                "url": "https://github.com/Shrinivassab"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 140 adds support for the <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#caret-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">caret-animation</code></a> property: see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5082469066604544\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5082469066604544</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds docs for it.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
